OL,3,GNEWSA'Historic occasion' for first
OL,4,Afemale bailiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first female bailiff in Guernsey
OL,7,Fhas been officially sworn into the
OL,8,Fcourts and is now the 91st bailiff of
OL,9,Fthe island.
OL,11,FJessica Roland became the first female
OL,12,Fdeputy bailiff when she was appointed
OL,13,Fin 2020, and received approval to
OL,14,Fbecome bailiff by the King in July.
OL,16,FShe is succeeding Sir Richard McMahon
OL,17,Fwho has been in the role since 2020.
OL,19,FIn her speech to the crowd of
OL,20,Fpoliticians and other members of the
OL,21,Fcourt, the new bailiff thanked her
OL,22,Ffamily and those around her.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
